# clasp pushes every supported file under rootDir (scripts/) unless this file
# excludes it, and the Apps Script parser rejects Node/bash helper scripts
# (gen-code-map.js's shebang broke the first Deploy run from the
# navigation-map merge). Deny everything first so a future helper script is
# ignored by default, then allowlist exactly the Apps Script files.
**/**
!appsscript.json
!Code.gs
!ProvisionDoubles.gs
